      "markText": "str.format()也成了Python最为推荐的字符串格式化方法，当然也是最Pythonic的。",
      "totalCount": 187
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 71220975,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_8_2177-2257",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "2177-2257",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "有人说，写代码就像写诗，你见过谁在自己写的诗里加注释吗？这种说法受到许多人的追捧，包括一些Python程序员。但我的看法是，代码跟诗不太一样，需要适当添加注释。",
      "totalCount": 120
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 7538486,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_59_2869-2936",
      "chapterUid": 59,
      "range": "2869-2936",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "所以当我们向其中增加新的基类时，这个类就拥有了新的方法，也就是所谓的混入（mixin）。这种动态性的好处在于代码获得了更丰富的扩展功能",
      "totalCount": 90
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 74723900,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_6_836-849",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "836-849",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "避免使用容易引起混淆的名称",
      "totalCount": 85
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 16401603,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_21_2845-2865",
      "chapterUid": 21,
      "range": "2845-2865",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "判断两个对象相等应该使用==而不是is。",
      "totalCount": 84
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 45119965,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_5_3248-3339",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "3248-3339",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "通过上述代码的对比，能让大家清晰地认识到Pythonic的一个要求，就是对Python语法本身的充分发挥，写出来的代码带着Python味儿，而不是看着像C语言代码，或者Java代码。",
      "totalCount": 80
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 222070255,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_40_1117-1160",
      "chapterUid": 40,
      "range": "1117-1160",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "在解释器中直接输入a时默认调用repr()函数，而print a则调用str()函数。",
      "totalCount": 75
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 17047351,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_7_2945-2983",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "2945-2983",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不要被其他语言的思维和习惯困扰，掌握Python的哲学和思维方式才是硬道理。",
      "totalCount": 68
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 38816334,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_17_2665-2724",
      "chapterUid": 17,
      "range": "2665-2724",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "基于内建类型扩展的用户自定义类型，type函数并不能准确返回结果。",
      "totalCount": 68
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 64619709,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_21_2373-2412",
      "chapterUid": 21,
      "range": "2373-2412",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这是Python中的string interning（字符串驻留）机制所决定的",
      "totalCount": 68
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 274787364,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_25_5150-5180",
      "chapterUid": 25,
      "range": "5150-5180",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "而解决循环嵌套导入问题的一个方法是直接使用import语句。",
      "totalCount": 68
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 51801193,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_15_1188-1240",
      "chapterUid": 15,
      "range": "1188-1240",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "因此在编程过程中，如果对于or条件表达式应该将值为真可能性较高的变量写在or的前面，而and则应该推后。",
      "totalCount": 66
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 274787364,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_38_1686-1751",
      "chapterUid": 38,
      "range": "1686-1751",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果不想让默认参数所指向的对象在所有的函数调用中被共享，而是在函数调用的过程中动态生成，可以在定义的时候使用None对象作为占位符",
      "totalCount": 65
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 11431111,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_6_6254-6308",
      "chapterUid": 6,
      "range": "6254-6308",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "其实Pythonic的代码，往往是放弃自我风格的代码，而要有“放弃自我风格”的觉悟，是非常困难、非常痛苦的。",
      "totalCount": 64
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 34932803,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_7_730-759",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "730-759",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "空格或者Tab键不再是你心血来潮的时候可以随便敲敲解闷的了",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
      "userVid": 40383555,
      "bookmarkId": "621966_9_2258-2281",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "2258-2281",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "尽量使代码占用更少的篇幅，采取了第二种排版形式",
      "totalCount": 54
    },
    {
      "bookId": "621966",
